`timescale 1fs/1fs
//======================================================================
// inv1_ms_pkg -- the mixed-signal agent for inv1_rnm.
//
// Item / driver / monitor / agent / sequencer / sequences.  The golden
// table lives here too, so the sequence item and the scoreboard read the
// same numbers.
//
// THE GOLDEN TABLE IS NGSPICE DATA, not the fitted transfer function.
// Checking the model against the fit would be checking it against the
// equations it implements -- it would pass unconditionally and mean
// nothing.  GOLD_X/GOLD_Y are 41 operating points measured from
// the circuit during characterization.
//
// AUTO-GENERATED by spice2rnm (Veylon Systems).  Edits will be overwritten.
//======================================================================
package inv1_ms_pkg;

  import uvm_pkg::*;
  import inv1_proxy_pkg::*;
  `include "uvm_macros.svh"

  //--------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Golden operating points, measured by ngspice during characterization.
